# New Castle Live Weather Dashboard

A lightweight, modern frontend application that communicates directly with global environmental sensors to deliver real-time metrics for New Castle, DE. 

## Features
- **Asynchronous Pipeline:** Built entirely using modern `async/await` JavaScript data streaming patterns.
- **Clean Separation:** Decouples core app configuration, rendering scripts, structural markers, and visual element layers.
- **Developer Layout Mode:** Outputs structured, contextual live telemetry in a readable monospaced terminal matrix.

## Project Structure
```text
├── index.html         # Live dashboard gateway
├── about.html         # Biography section profile 
├── assets/
│   └── css/
│       └── style.css  # Application layout theme styles
└── src/
    └── app.js         # API interface scripts & error handling structures
```

## How to Install and Run Locally
1. Clone the repository directly onto your desktop workspace.
2. Launch your local tracking server program or double-click `index.html` to execute the web system.
